-------------------------------------------

inputs_compare_std4

Standard problem 4.
Entire domain is magnetic.
Matches comapre_std.m
==================== Initial Setup ====================
 demag_coupling       = 1
 M_normalization      = 1
 exchange_coupling    = 1
 DMI_coupling         = 0
 anisotropy_coupling  = 0
 TimeIntegratorOption = 1

